  {"comment":"SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT"},
  {"comment":"A cable gland body cut in its profile's plane (mitcad#1230, tools/ui-section-gland-test.sh): every profile in Sketch1, Sketch2 and Sketch3 on the XY plane, turned about the Y axis. Revolve1 (F2): a tube 24 to 60 mm across and 45 long (Body1, F2.b0); Revolve2 (F4) cuts a 42 mm bore 18 deep at y = 0; Revolve3 (F6) turns the shank down to 30 mm from y = 27. Thread1 (F7): a modelled M45x3 internal thread in the bore; Thread2 (F8): a modelled M30x2 external thread on the shank. Section Analysis Off at the XY plane moved 1 mm, and Profile at the XY plane itself (Distance 0: the profiles' plane, through the axis), Profile shown."},
  {"cmd":"sketch.create"},
  {"cmd":"sketch.add_rectangle","sketch":"F1","corner":[12,0],"width":18,"height":45},
  {"cmd":"add_feature","def":{"type":"revolve","profiles":[{"sketch":"F1","region":"r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "axis":"y","extent":{"type":"full"},"operation":"new_body"}},
  {"cmd":"sketch.create"},
